sequenceDiagram
    participant GUI as GUI
    participant ACQ as Moduł akwizycji
    participant ENG as Silnik reguł
    participant DB as Baza danych

    GUI->>ACQ: startSession(vehicleId)
    loop co interwał
        ACQ->>ACQ: readOBD()
        ACQ->>ENG: evaluate(reading)
        ENG->>DB: save(reading, metrics)
        alt threshold exceeded
            ENG->>DB: save(alertEvent)
            ENG-->>GUI: pushAlert(severity, message)
        else normal
            ENG-->>GUI: pushLiveMetrics()
        end
    end
    GUI->>ACQ: stopSession()
